osely to</a></td><td>Composition.section.entry (A reference to data that supports this section)</td><td>Selon le type d'activité portée par FRLMCarePlan.activity, la ressource FHIR concrète référencée est l'une de : FRProcedureDocument, FRServiceRequestDocument, FRMedicationRequestDocument, FRImmunizationDocument ou FREncounterDocument.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRSectionCarePlansLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRSectionCarePlansLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRSectionCarePlansLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMCarePlans</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-plan-de-soins.html\">CDA - FR Plan de soinsversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMCarePlans</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section (FRCDAPlanDeSoins)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMCarePlans.codeSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.code (Code de la section)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMCarePlans.titleSection</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.title (Titre de la section)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMCarePlans.description</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-eq